Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.38,0:00:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.62,0:00:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I see an island!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks uninhabited to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready the anchor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find me some ingredients and\NI'll start cooking lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.42,0:00:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, nothing's slimy or gross, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once it's in your stomach,\Nit's all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over yourself. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.40,0:00:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, did you\Nfind any new herbs to use?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.11,0:00:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place has all sorts of neat stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a good stock, but I'm still\Nlooking in case I missed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.78,0:00:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which reminds me, I noticed\Nsomething weird a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.14,0:00:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a little groove\Nalong the trail here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.76,0:00:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like a bicycle or\Nsomething came through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.74,0:00:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, that doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nobody else on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would there be a bicycle?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:00:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost through the jungle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's a letdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just looks like a whole\Nlot of nothing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.98,0:01:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I miss something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.18,0:01:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.60,0:01:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he found some new herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.32,0:01:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, you cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were gonna hog that big mushroom\Nall to yourself, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.52,0:01:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened? Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be something behind that rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.85,0:01:36.80,Captions,,0,930,80,,{\fad(200,150)}Havy HQ Admiral\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NAokiji
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.94,0:01:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're not a mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.10,0:01:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A raccoon dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.10,0:01:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see the antlers?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.34,0:01:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw you fall. Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.32,0:01:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Someone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.72,0:01:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:01:58.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hit my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:01:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:01.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we were alone on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, is this guy an enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.68,0:02:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Robin's freaking out, then\Nso am I. Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.90,0:02:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I know you're surprised to\Nsee me, but don't get so worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.24,0:02:29.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I came here on\Nofficial orders or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a nice day, so I decided\Nto go for a ride. Orders, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who is it you work for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:41.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.90,0:02:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've grown into quite the\Nlovely lady, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.58,0:02:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:51.32,0:02:55.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,75)}It's all right! Now let's move forward
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.65,0:02:58.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,with the sun always in our hearts
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.02,0:03:02.32,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,As power passes through our clasped hands
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.46,0:03:06.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's grab hold of our wishes{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.57,0:03:19.11,OP11 Credits,,50,0,230,,Translation\N FUNimation
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.57,0:03:19.81,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Working together, let's ride the giant waves{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.84,0:03:24.33,OP11 Credits,,450,0,280,,Soundtracking\NHalee
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.84,0:03:24.33,OP11 Credits,,0,460,350,,Infoboxes/Title Card\N BernieCrane
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.15,0:03:27.59,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}Let's hurry toward the excitement--\Nthere's the starting signal{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.42,0:03:28.32,OP11 Credits,,0,100,420,,Editing\NFeeso
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.32,0:03:34.41,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now's the time to set sail-- let's raise anchor{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.82,0:03:34.39,OP11 Credits,,470,0,300,,Quality Checking\NGalaxy 9000\NMr. Luffy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.26,0:03:42.35,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1\fad(0,50)}Cut through the rainbow-colored wind\Nand head for a sea of adventure{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.40,0:03:45.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It'll be a journey fraught with injury{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.92,0:03:49.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but what you cherish most will be right there{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.78,0:03:53.71,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And if you get into a jam{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.78,0:03:53.75,OP11 Credits,,0,30,410,,Timing\NDatenshi
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.78,0:03:55.67,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll always be there to protect you{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.78,0:04:00.62,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's all right! Now let's move forward{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go ahead and go ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.99,0:04:04.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}with the sun always in our hearts{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.32,0:04:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moon will always come to the moon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind will come to the sky\Nand see the light of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.49,0:04:07.63,Lyrics,,0,0,1,,{\i1}If a storm hits, let's put\Nour arms around each other{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.73,0:04:11.50,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,0)}{\i1}and gaze at the light beyond{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.74,0:04:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.00,0:04:15.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we gather up the pieces of our dreams{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.73,0:04:18.84,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}they'll make a map leading to tomorrow{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.00,0:04:22.01,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}So let's grab hold of our wishes{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.47,0:04:27.75,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\i1}under the same flag-- together, we're one{\i}
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.57,0:04:40.48,Title,,0,0,230,,{\fad(920,350)}Navy HQ Admiral Aokiji
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy has Robin scared out\Nof her freaking mind. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a Marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Navy Headquarters Admiral Aokiji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.44,0:05:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you mean this guy's an admiral?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.44,0:05:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one of the highest ranks there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.18,0:05:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are only three\Nofficers in the entire
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.08,0:05:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Navy who currently hold\Nthe position of admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akainu, Aokiji, and Kizaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.46,0:05:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only one above them is Fleet Admiral\NSengoku, the Navy's top official.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man you see standing\Nbefore you is one of the three
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,men known as the world\Ngovernment's ultimate powerhouses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why in the heck is\Nsomeone like this even here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should you be out hunting\Nsome big-time pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:48.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a bazillion berry\Nbounties or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.26,0:05:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.94,0:05:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another very sexy lady with super\Nbig bazongas. Are you free tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.10,0:06:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You watch your mouth, you lanky\Njerk! Hey, focus! Pay attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, hold on a second, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear what I just said?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.12,0:06:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just out taking a little stroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get so worked up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.02,0:06:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you guys are just, you're like\Njust whatchamacallits, you know? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense, you weirdo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.16,0:06:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be mistaken him for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.34,0:06:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This doofus wouldn't pass for a\Nregular Marine, let alone an Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't go around judging\Npeople based on their appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The motto I've always lived by\Nas a Marine is lazy justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.18,0:06:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then our judgment was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what I was saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.58,0:06:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being on my feet too long\Nmakes me tired. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.38,0:06:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then maybe you shouldn't have been\Nsleeping standing up, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.34,0:06:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I was saying is\Nthat I have no intention
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.94,0:07:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of capturing you or anything like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.18,0:07:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so just take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm only here to confirm the\Nwhereabouts of Nico Robin,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who hadn't been seen since\Nthe Alabasta incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As we suspected, she's been with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is one tall piece of apathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:15.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing high-ranking\Nabout him is his nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll put some sort of report\Ntogether for headquarters later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've added another crew\Nmember who's got a price on her head,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.90,0:07:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your overall bounty has gone up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,$100 million plus $60 million\Nplus $79 million equals...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.40,0:07:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, screw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some big-ass number.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do the damn math.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it! Come, come!\NHold on, Luffy! Stop it!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.03,0:07:41.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rubber!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.36,0:07:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing? Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.76,0:07:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to start\Na fight with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.71,0:07:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's one of the strongest\NMarines there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.38,0:07:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not just gonna stand around while this\Njerk tries to take Robin away from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:07:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm not gonna\Ndo anything, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm just
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out on a stroll stroll
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.40,0:08:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh go take your stroll somewhere else
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.72,0:08:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get out of here why are you so angry at\Nme looks like he's trying to pick a fight
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you're really a\Nmarine I wish we'd known
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that a lot sooner hey\Nwho are all these people
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:29.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought this island was uninhabited.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.06,0:08:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they're probably castaways\Nthat washed up on the shore here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.32,0:08:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a passenger liner that was\Nreported missing about a month ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last seen somewhere in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing it sank.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And these are the survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.14,0:08:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.54,0:08:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll leave, but before I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys should gather your stuff\Nand get ready to leave, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:09:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I know of an inhabited island\Nthat's not too far away from this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should go there and\Nask them to help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't believe a word he says!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.94,0:09:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This jerk's a marine officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:15.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what? Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.40,0:09:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.26,0:09:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally, the Marines are your friends\Nand the Pirates are the bad guys, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! What's so funny? Him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.18,0:09:31.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is he going to help\Nanybody? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heck, I don't even think he has a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Other than ours, there isn't\Nanother ship around anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no ship and nobody here\Nseems to have a Log Pose either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the world are they supposed\Nto get to that island anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, they'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing you say sounds\Nthe least bit convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He does have the power to help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We loaded them up with food and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be enough to last\Nthem for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:14.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feels good to do a little\Nwork from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.10,0:10:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no doubt about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.54,0:10:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.45,0:10:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.92,0:10:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.90,0:10:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're hitting it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to swim\Nto that island to drag
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these guys and all their stuff behind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:26.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everybody, stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's some kind of monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:11:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it's the guardian\Nof this part of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run for it! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.01,0:11:11.57,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rubber...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.67,0:11:15.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ice Age!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:15.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice Age.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.80,0:11:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea, it's frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the power of a\NNavy Headquarters Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.32,0:12:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll stay like that for at least a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head out across the sea in\Nthat direction. Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should reach the\Nisland in about four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to be a little on the chilly\Nside, so be sure to bundle up and stay warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.74,0:12:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea has become as hard as the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.50,0:12:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can finally cross it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we'll be able to\Nget off of this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.64,0:12:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.94,0:12:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Marine granted us a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for us to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.38,0:13:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.29,0:13:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy for you guys. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess there are all sorts\Nof different pirates, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can we ever thank you for\Neverything that you've done for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.78,0:13:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only did you treat\Nour sick and injured,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.02,0:13:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you shared your food\Nand water with us as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good things happen to good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.74,0:13:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just let fate take its course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure the children don't catch cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep them bundled up tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, these colder temperatures\Nshould keep your food fresh longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you all very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.18,0:13:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will never forget your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care, Straw Hat pirates! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful on your trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Safe journeys to Pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.96,0:13:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That felt really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.88,0:13:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like winter just happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out! I can skate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome, jumper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:13:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, it's cold. I'm freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How should I put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.52,0:14:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the spitting image of\Nyour grandfather, Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.92,0:14:12.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.28,0:14:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I should say you're just\Nas reckless and hard to figure out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.82,0:14:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew my grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously? Luffy's?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.38,0:14:31.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.28,0:14:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your grandfather helped me\Nout once, a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see you and Nico\NRobin together with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On second thought, maybe\NI should just kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government still doesn't\Nconsider you a threat,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.56,0:14:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I know enough of your history\Nto see you're a formidable crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.10,0:15:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be few in number, but with\Nthe shrewd rogues gathered here,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.96,0:15:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this crew will likely\Nbe a problem later on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Considering the circumstances\Nregarding your initial bounty,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.30,0:15:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the numerous daring actions you've taken,\Nand the speed of your overall progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.36,0:15:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've fought outlaws for most of my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but thinking about how you'll turn\Nout scares the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.42,0:15:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.36,0:15:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you were here to check\Nthings out, not to kill anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One among you I consider\Nthe most dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.48,0:15:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be you, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.86,0:15:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So despite everything,\Nyou are here for Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.18,0:15:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm really gonna kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.98,0:15:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The size of her bounty isn't merely a\Nreflection of her strength and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.62,0:15:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It also represents something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be the level of threat and danger\Nthat she poses to the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why a 79-million-Berry\Nbounty was placed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.82,0:15:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on her head at the tender\Nyoung age of eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you were able to\Nsurvive, especially as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.70,0:16:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You managed to betray, sidestep, and\Nescape from everyone in your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.76,0:16:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then found a new\Npartner to make you some.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You survived in the underworld\Nby being quick to switch sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now you've chosen this\Ncrew as your next haven.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.56,0:16:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not just gonna stand here and\Nlet you speak to a lady like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of ridiculous grudge\Nare you holding against Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.66,0:16:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have anything against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.86,0:16:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only connection we have between us is\Nthat I let her escape from me one time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will all learn soon\Nenough that protecting
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.14,0:16:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this troublesome woman\Nleads to nothing but regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need proof, consider this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every organization that\Nshe's had something
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.52,0:16:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to do with in the past\Nhas been annihilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.52,0:16:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not one single solitary\Nmember escaped except for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.14,0:16:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is that, Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.30,0:16:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.70,0:16:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The past doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.28,0:16:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:17:00.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So these poor fools don't suspect a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.42,0:17:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get to the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.26,0:17:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to arrest me, then\Nwhy not just do it already?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.78,0:17:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince of Lure!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.49,0:17:07.38,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Treinta Fleurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.50,0:17:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my, my Did something\NI say strike a nerve?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.73,0:17:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have overestimated how\Nreasonable a woman you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And clutch.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.17,0:17:18.03,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Clutch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shattered it to a million pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't work. We're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.66,0:17:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.44,0:17:36.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run for your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.66,0:17:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.98,0:17:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't a very nice thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.78,0:18:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice Sabre, I didn't want to\Nhave to kill you, but now.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.79,0:18:04.19,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ice Saber!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.83,0:18:22.71,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Slice Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.26,0:18:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slice shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come go!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.43,0:18:26.49,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rubber...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crystal!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.65,0:18:31.83,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He froze up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He froze up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got all three of them at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's freezing them solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.86,0:19:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to help quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.34,0:19:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they get frostbite, their\Nlips will start to rot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.12,0:19:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ossum, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to save them now. I want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.10,0:19:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to, but I can't see them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he freeze me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.42,0:19:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're just too scared\Nto move, coward. Ah! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.64,0:19:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanzidoro, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.51,0:19:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, run! Away. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.78,0:19:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have some very loyal friends, but\Nyou will never change, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.70,0:19:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.02,0:19:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.30,0:19:40.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.84,0:19:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.94,0:19:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.38,0:20:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.84,0:20:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you thaw her out\Ncarefully, she'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.78,0:20:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her body is extremely fragile in this state,\Nso you'll need to handle her with care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If any part of her breaks, she'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.36,0:20:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example, if I were to\Nsmash her apart like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.02,0:20:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noooooooooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:50.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nooooooooooooooo! stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.22,0:21:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.86,0:21:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, chumper, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.62,0:21:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take Robin and run back to the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw her out and keep her safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, you got it, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, be gentle, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.36,0:21:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.42,0:21:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but Robin's even colder, genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.14,0:21:38.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world would be a much better\Nplace without that woman in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.62,0:21:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to split hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a pirate crew pretty much\Nconsists of people just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.44,0:21:49.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got that right, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.76,0:21:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, if you don't mind, kindly step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.90,0:21:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nani!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna mess\Nwith this crew! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:21:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody attack him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.64,0:22:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay back and don't interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.90,0:22:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fight him one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.36,0:22:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.86,0:22:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of us can settle this on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.08,0:22:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.48,0:22:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But since I don't have a ship to take you\Nback, then I'll just have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.48,0:22:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can't breathe like this, can she?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.94,0:22:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she's in a state\Nof suspended animation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.38,0:22:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean she'll die\Nif we don't do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we warm her up too\Nquickly, she'll shatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.96,0:22:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to restore her body\Ntemperature from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.14,0:22:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that this\Nis really going to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.34,0:22:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it's the only thing I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.06,0:22:48.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.97,0:22:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.89,0:22:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Robin's life\Nwe're talking about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.16,0:22:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but I've never treated someone\Nwhose entire body was frozen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.88,0:22:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that Aokiji said\Nshe was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.96,0:23:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I just don't see how\Nthat could be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.58,0:23:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.58,0:23:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't do anything to save her,\Nthen no one in the whole world can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.82,0:23:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the doctor of the\NStraw Hat pirates, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.24,0:23:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.24,0:23:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and stop yelling at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.90,0:23:31.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.62,0:23:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.62,0:23:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are just the three of you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.10,0:23:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.01,0:23:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.44,0:23:43.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to go back right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us do something about\Nthis frozen arm and leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.78,0:23:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.69,0:23:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to douse every part of\Nyour body that's frozen in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.28,0:23:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're using the shower room\Nfor Robin. How is Robin? Is she OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.06,0:23:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's too early to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.12,0:23:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.48,0:24:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will this do chop her?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.30,0:24:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.21,0:24:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the ice begins to melt,\Nstart rubbing the affected areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.94,0:24:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then come up to the ship right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.56,0:24:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, come aboard and help\Nus treat Robin. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.60,0:24:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.51,0:24:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you guys here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.72,0:24:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened? Where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.96,0:24:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting out Cage one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.22,0:24:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One-on-one?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.42,0:24:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you left Luffy there\Nto face him all by himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.62,0:24:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those were the captain's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.62,0:24:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.70,0:24:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you tell what an\Norder is unreasonable?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.52,0:24:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you would be so cold-hearted\Nthat I should just leave it there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.52,0:24:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a duel, can't you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.84,0:24:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what he wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.86,0:24:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, both of you, this isn't the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.84,0:24:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, we need to stay focused, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.34,0:24:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether this decision was one of his\Npassing whims or not, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.32,0:25:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, we have to be\Nready to deal with it, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.62,0:25:13.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are an odd one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 1,0:25:37.91,0:25:40.05,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rubber...
Dialogue: 1,0:25:40.62,0:25:44.08,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Storm!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.24,0:25:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's ice time.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:54.15,0:25:56.47,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ice Time...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.30,0:26:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say the two of us can?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.76,0:26:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,settle this on our own oh man you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.34,0:26:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tricked me the moment i agreed to\Nfight you one-on-one i settled on
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.78,0:26:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,defeating you and you alone but that\Nwas your plan wasn't it if i were
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.66,0:26:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to attack your crew now i'd be the\Nbad guy here isn't that right captain
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.12,0:26:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.03,0:26:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you actually\Nthought you could beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.80,0:26:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me give you a piece of advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.44,0:26:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep a close eye on Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.16,0:26:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eventually, she'll grow to\Nbe more than you can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.46,0:27:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The nature of the violent\Nfate she was born into.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.82,0:27:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will be a greater danger\Nthan you can imagine!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.60,0:27:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More of a burden than you\Ncould ever hope to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.10,0:27:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what it means to have\Nthat woman as part of your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.64,0:27:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have been warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.44,0:27:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.36,0:27:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.56,0:27:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be easy to break you\Nand kill you right here and now,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.22,0:27:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have a debt to honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.64,0:27:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider us even for you taking\Ncare of crocodile, as well as...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.88,0:27:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh, well, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.94,0:27:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something to do with Smoker?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.86,0:27:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.64,0:28:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.32,0:28:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.08,0:28:08.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.68,0:28:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.26,0:28:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll carry him, let's get him to the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.02,0:28:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop saying what I'm saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.20,0:28:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they follow their log from this\Nisland, their next destination is
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.72,0:28:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Water 7, the city of water, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.70,0:28:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh my my my?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.34,0:28:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would you look at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.68,0:28:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're getting really close to\Nour headquarters, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.80,0:29:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of their hearts are beating!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.34,0:29:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.14,0:29:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.52,0:29:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't go in yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.14,0:29:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want them disturbed, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.28,0:29:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.46,0:29:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, how about I make them some food?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.74,0:29:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calling me doctor won't make me feel\Nhappy or anything, you stupid jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.72,0:29:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I suppose some warm drinks\Nwould be nice for when they wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.06,0:29:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll carry them into the lounge later.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.18,0:29:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye, aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.84,0:29:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, should we set sail?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.08,0:29:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.20,0:29:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not while the captain's out of commission.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.20,0:29:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The lock pose has our new heading,\Nbut let's rest here for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.60,0:29:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.00,0:29:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.54,0:29:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are there going to be more guys like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.14,0:29:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coming after us everywhere we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.72,0:29:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.34,0:30:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much\Nmore of it I can take.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.50,0:30:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get some sleep, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.26,0:30:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just exhausted, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.92,0:30:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

